<main aria-labelledby="title">
    <h2 id="title">About Umbilo</h2><p>
        Umbilo is a residential area in Durban, KwaZulu-Natal, with a diverse and growing community.
        It offers rooms for rent and provides convenient access to nearby shops, schools, public transport, and other local services.
    </p>

    <p>
        The area is suitable for students, workers, and individuals looking for affordable accommodation in a convenient location.
        Umbilo provides easy access to surrounding areas of Durban, making it a practical place to live.
    </p>

</main>